# Fase 1 — Smoke REST (VS Code / Cursor REST Client)
@host = http://localhost:5180
@correo = admin@local
@password = 123456
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}
@usuarioId = 2

### SMK-API-0 Health
GET {{host}}/health

### SMK-API-1 Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/SGR/AuthService/GenerateToken
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "{{correo}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### SMK-API-2 Dashboard
GET {{host}}/Dashboard/Resumen
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SMK-API-3 Tickets admin
GET {{host}}/TKT/Tickets/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SMK-API-4 Finanzas admin
GET {{host}}/FNZ/Cuotas?usuarioId={{usuarioId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SMK-API-5 Notificaciones
GET {{host}}/NTF/Notificaciones?pagina=1&tamano=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
